          "label": "We Protect Our Own",
          "kind": "text",
          "default": {
            "id": "9773c514cd59c685",
            "title": "We Protect Our Own",
            "subtitle": "",
            "body": "Our movement carries pit energy: when someone gets knocked down, we pick them up. We look out for each other, make space for one another, and refuse to leave people behind. We believe strength comes from solidarity, and real community means showing up, standing together, and helping each other through the fight.",
